          "index": 4,
          "text": "{current}/{required} Servants of Sevine Freed",
          "type": "monster"
        }
      ],
      "summary": "Free nine Servants of Razelikh, three Servants of Sevine, three Servants of Allistarj, and three Servants of Grol. Return to the Fallen Hero when your task is complete. You must remain within close proximity of the stones or the process will fail.",
